No, actually you can. In fact, I'm posting the solution:

Whatever you do, the ant will get in one round of attacks. You cannot
survive a second round. Attacking the ant directly will take too long;
it's unlikely you can kill it in one turn.
However, you are on a web. Step off to the NW, and the ant will move
after you, getting in one attack. Move towards the corpse, and the ant
will not follow as it is stuck in a web. Bugs stuck in a web (as well
as most NPCs) won't be going anywhere for a long time.
Take the unicorn horn, apply it, and then shoot the ant down from a
distance; you have plenty of ranged weapons.



